   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is it possible to deployApp from github rather than from my local account. or<div>Is it possible to automatically deploy from github when the version changes?</div><div><br></div><div>I could possibly  just deploy  a script with the command:</div><div>runGitHub(&quot;newOI&quot;,dshanabrook)</div><div>which contains the repository and my user name.  But assuming this will be rather slow and inefficient? </div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;padding:9.5px;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.428571429;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-right-width:1px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-style:none solid solid none;border-right-color:white;border-bottom-color:white;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:&#39;Source Code Pro&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">runGitHub</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span></span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;&lt;your repository name&gt;&quot;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">,</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;&lt;your user name&gt;&quot;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></span> </code></pre></div></div>"
    ]
