   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">David,<div><br></div><div>Deploying directly from Git or GitHub is not something we support right now, and I would NOT recommend using runGitHub inside your application.</div><div><br></div><div>We might look at adding some features around GitHub integration in the next few months, but we haven&#39;t finalized how this will work yet.</div><div><br></div><div>-Andy</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Thu, Sep 3, 2015 at 1:40 PM, david shanabrook <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dhsh...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
